#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:22 index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<application>Pairs</application> editor is a part of <application>Pairs</"
"application> Project. It can be used to make and edit themes for "
"<application>Pairs</application>."
msgstr ""
"<application>Parovi</application> urednik je dio <application>Parova</"
"application> projekta. To se može koristiti za izradu i uređivanje tema "
"za<application>Parovi</application>."

