#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Pairs Editor"
msgstr "Uređivač parova"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:53
#, no-c-format
msgid "Main Toolbar"
msgstr "Glavna alatna traka"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:54
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It consists of 5 buttons which can be resized or whose text can be altered."
msgstr ""
"Sastoji se od pet tipki čije se veličine mogu mijenjati ili čiji tekst se "
"može mijenjati."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:56
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>New</title>"
msgstr "<title>Novo</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "The button can be used to create a new theme."
msgstr "Tipka se može koristiti za pravljenje novih tema."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Otvoren"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "This button can be used to open an existing theme."
msgstr "Ova tipka se može koristiti za otvaranje postojeće teme."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:64
#, no-c-format
msgid "Save/Save as"
msgstr "Snimi/Snimi kao"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:65
#, no-c-format
msgid "These two buttons are used to save the created theme."
msgstr "Ove dvije tipke su korištene za snimanje napravljene teme."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Try</title>"
msgstr "<title>Pokušati</title>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<guilabel>Try</guilabel> button is used for trying the theme that is "
"created. It will launch <application>Pairs</application> with the new theme."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Pokušati</guilabel> tipka se koristi za pokretanje teme koja je "
"napravljana. To će pokrenuti <application>Parovi</application> sa novom "
"temom."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:73
#, no-c-format
msgid "Creating a new theme"
msgstr "Pravljenje nove teme"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:74
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Creating a new theme is quite easy and can be done using the following steps:"
msgstr ""
"Pravljenje nove teme je vrlo jednostavno i može biti učinjeno korištenjem "
"sledećih koraka:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Assign a Title, Description, Author, Date and version to the theme"
msgstr "Dodijeli temi Naziv, Objašnjenje, Autora, Datum i verziju."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Main Type</guilabel> describes the type of a theme. For "
"example, <guilabel>Image</guilabel> type is used if the theme is for pairing "
"the images."
msgstr ""
"<guilabel>Glavni tip</guilabel> opisuje tip teme. Kao primjer, "
"<guilabel>slika</guilabel>tip se koristi ako je tema za upoređivanje slika."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:79
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Include a back image. This image will be used in <application>Pairs</"
"application> as the image that would be displayed on the back of the cards."
msgstr ""
"Uključite pozadinsku sliku. Ova slika će se koristiti u <application>Parovi</"
"application> kao slika koja će biti prikazana na poleđini kartica."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add elements to the theme by pressing <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"Icon-list-add.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> and add images, words or sound to the elements. Elements "
"are used for defining relation between two images, words or sounds. For "
"example: Adding two images in one element will make those a pair. In case of "
"sounds, Two sounds are added in an element to make them a pair. And two "
"words can also be added to make them a pair. Adding a sound and an image "
"together in an element will make them a pair too."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj elemente temi pritiskajući <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"Icon-list-add.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> </"
"inlinemediaobject> i dodaj slike, riječi ili zvuk elementima. Elementi se "
"koriste za definiranje veze između dvije slike, riječi ili zvukova. Kao "
"primjer: Dodavanje dvije slike u jedan element činiće ih parom. U slučaju "
"zvukova, dva zvuka dodana u element čine ih parom. I dvije riječi takođe "
"mogu biti dodane da ih to čini parom. Dodavanjem zvuka i slike zajedno u "
"elemenat također ih čini parom."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:111
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Include <guilabel>Found Sound</guilabel>. Found sound is a sound that is "
"played when the element is correctly matched in <application>Pairs</"
"application>. There should be only one found sound for one element."
msgstr ""
"Uključite <guilabel>Pronađi zvuk</guilabel>. Pronađi zvuk je zvuk koji svira "
"kada se element pravilno poklopi u <application>Parovi</application>. Tu bi "
"trebao biti samo jedan pronađeni zvuk za jedan element."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:127
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Add more Elements. Adding elements increases the number of pairs in the game "
"which can be useful when more number of outcomes are needed."
msgstr ""
"Dodaj više elemenata. Dodavanje elemenata povećava broj parova u igri što "
"može biti korisno kada je potreban veći broj rezultata."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:143
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"After doing the mentioned steps, save your theme and hit the <guilabel>Try</"
"guilabel> button. It will launch <application>Pairs</application> with your "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"Nakon urađenih spomenutih koraka, snimi svoju temu i pritisni "
"<guilabel>Pokušaj</guilabel> tipku. To će pokrenuti <application>Parovi</"
"application> sa tvojom temom."

